<aside class="sidebar" aria-label="博客信息">
  <section class="profile-panel"><div class="profile-top"><div class="avatar-mark">P<span>_</span></div><span class="mono profile-id">EXPLORER / 001</span></div><h2>Hi, I'm PushyTao<span class="cyan">.</span></h2><p>保持热爱，保持思考。<br>把值得留下的想法，写成文字。</p><div class="profile-stats"><a href="<%- url_for('/archives/') %>"><strong><%= site.posts.length.toString().padStart(2,'0') %></strong><span>篇文章</span></a><a href="<%- url_for('/topics/') %>"><strong><%= site.categories.length.toString().padStart(2,'0') %></strong><span>个专题</span></a><a href="<%- url_for('/topics/#tags') %>"><strong><%= site.tags.length.toString().padStart(2,'0') %></strong><span>个标签</span></a></div><a class="profile-link" href="<%- url_for('/about/') %>">关于这个空间 <svg><use href="#i-up-right"/></svg></a></section>
  <section class="sidebar-section"><div class="mini-heading"><h2>探索专题</h2><span class="mono">TOPICS</span></div><div class="topic-links"><% site.categories.sort('name').each((category,i) => { %><a href="<%- url_for(category.path) %>"><span class="topic-number">0<%= i + 1 %></span><span><%= category.name %></span><span class="topic-count"><%= category.length %> <span>↗</span></span></a><% }); %></div></section>
  <section class="quote-panel"><span class="quote-symbol">“</span><p>把好奇心写进代码，<br>把思考留给时间。</p><span class="mono">A WORK IN PROGRESS.</span><div class="quote-orbit" aria-hidden="true"></div></section>
  <a class="rss-link" href="<%- url_for('/atom.xml') %>"><svg><use href="#i-rss"/></svg><span>保持连接<small>通过 RSS 订阅新文章</small></span><span>↗</span></a>
</aside>
